  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proposal of reform to the public policy and legal framework of territorial planning in Colombia in order to comply with the Paris Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s first year focused on diagnosing territorial planning in Colombia and its broken links with environmental planning. The first phase accomplished a detailed diagnostic broadly discussed and supported by experts and interest groups. It also identified the needed reforms to achieve an updated framework that enables sustainable territorial development and the achievements of the Paris Agreement commitments.</narrative>
  </description>
